/* body. figures — the four silhouettes.

   Traced from Wikimedia Commons
   "Dermatomes_labeled,_female-male_front-back_3d-shaded.svg", which carries
   exactly what this app needs: female and male, front and back, as vectors
   with hands and feet intact. Pipeline was saturation mask -> largest
   connected component -> hole fill -> Moore-neighbour boundary following ->
   Douglas-Peucker -> smoothed quadratic path. All four share a 220x460 box,
   so organ placements are directly comparable between them.

   Organ illustrations in assets/organs/ are sliced from the Freepik/Magnific
   organ infographic (references/icons-for-organs.svg). Regions with no honest
   illustration keep an original drawn glyph below. */

